{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/a91c3532af30031bbb5c6ab89372e7d9.avif?t=1772812121\" width=618 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the cat. Live by your own rules \ud83d\udc31<br><br>In Cat Life Simulator, you step into the carefree and unpredictable life of a real street cat. Explore a lively open world where every house, alley, and rooftop can lead to a new adventure\u2026 or get you kicked out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between three unique cats and personalize your look with fun accessories like collars, bows, and quirky hats. Roam the city freely and interact with the world however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/d029263d19e1e9eab34f6205071a5f70.poster.avif?t=1772812121\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/d029263d19e1e9eab34f6205071a5f70.webm?t=1772812121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/d029263d19e1e9eab34f6205071a5f70.mp4?t=1772812121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Realistic Cat Behavior<br>Scratch furniture, nap wherever you want, purr happily, and knock things over - just be a cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/74e3cd209e060891514f7e56af2edcf4.poster.avif?t=1772812121\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/74e3cd209e060891514f7e56af2edcf4.webm?t=1772812121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/74e3cd209e060891514f7e56af2edcf4.mp4?t=1772812121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9 Explore a Vibrant Open World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter houses, climb rooftops, wander through alleys, and discover new places across the city. But remember: every home has an owner, and not everyone welcomes surprise visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/83e2cf4a40e983bcbdb116bdedad5884.poster.avif?t=1772812121\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/83e2cf4a40e983bcbdb116bdedad5884.webm?t=1772812121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/83e2cf4a40e983bcbdb116bdedad5884.mp4?t=1772812121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc36 Animal Missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with or compete against other animals in unique quests across the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Interact With People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach anyone you meet - beg for food, charm them with your cuteness, or simply get in their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/371363a7db07ff458acd0226b2fffa6c.poster.avif?t=1772812121\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/371363a7db07ff458acd0226b2fffa6c.webm?t=1772812121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/371363a7db07ff458acd0226b2fffa6c.mp4?t=1772812121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e Hidden Treasures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the city to collect hidden items scattered throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own story as a street cat and turn everyday chaos into adventure. Are you ready to become a true street legend? \ud83d\udc3e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2607420?t=1772812121","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/2488af13a9b52b8b456764b573f0ba4240aa4291/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772812121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/99f4aa808f1ed6fbd2deb18e4d00ea06a0fa860b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772812121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/99f4aa808f1ed6fbd2deb18e4d00ea06a0fa860b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772812121","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607420/extras/a91c3532af30031bbb5c6ab89372e7d9.avif?t=1772812121\" width=618 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the cat. Live by your own rules \ud83d\udc31<br><br>In Cat Life Simulator, you step into the carefree and unpredictable life of a real street cat. Explore a lively open world where every house,